BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:barge2026-no-kings-nlhe
DTSTAMP:20260622T180000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260720T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260720T233000
SUMMARY:No Kings NLHE Memorial Charity Tournament
DESCRIPTION:Entry: $140 ($60 rebuys)\n\nIn memory of Peter Secor\, Gillian Groves\, Tanya Peck-Devenport\, Alan Bostick\, and Art Reber. Standard no limit hold'em except kings are stripped from the deck. Unlimited $60 rebuys during first hour. All players may add-on for $60 at first break. All rebuy/add-on proceeds to be donated to charities.
LOCATION:The Orleans Hotel & Casino\, Las Vegas\, NV
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:barge2026-triple-draw-dc
DTSTAMP:20260622T180000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260721T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260721T170000
SUMMARY:Triple Draw Dealer's Choice
DESCRIPTION:Entry: $100 w/re-entry\n\n6 handed\; all games are played limit. Dealer's choice of the following games: A-5 Triple Draw\, 2-7 Triple Draw\, Archie\, Badugi\, Badacey\, Badeucey\, Draw High (no bug).
LOCATION:The Orleans Hotel & Casino\, Las Vegas\, NV
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:barge2026-oe
DTSTAMP:20260622T180000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260721T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260721T230000
SUMMARY:OE
DESCRIPTION:Entry: $140 w/re-entry\n\nAlternating rounds of Omaha/8 and Stud/8. forever.
LOCATION:The Orleans Hotel & Casino\, Las Vegas\, NV
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:barge2026-savage-average-nlhe
DTSTAMP:20260622T180000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260722T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260722T190000
SUMMARY:Savage Average NLHE with Nit Levels
DESCRIPTION:Entry: $140 w/re-entry\n\nDynamic blinds are used instead of a tournament clock. Levels progress as players are eliminated to maintain an average stack of at least 50 big blinds. Featuring Nit Levels.
LOCATION:The Orleans Hotel & Casino\, Las Vegas\, NV
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:barge2026-wonky-action-razr
DTSTAMP:20260622T180000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260722T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260722T233000
SUMMARY:Wonky Action Razz (second chance event)
DESCRIPTION:Entry: $100 w/re-entry\n\nLimit mix of Wonky Donkey and Action Razz\; games change by level. In Wonky Donkey\, players receive two cards. If the majority of the flop is red\, the game is hold'em. If the majority of the flop is black\, players receive two more cards and the game is Omaha 8 or better.
LOCATION:The Orleans Hotel & Casino\, Las Vegas\, NV
END:VEVENT

